{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/clinical-summary.schema.json",
  "title": "ClinicalSummarySchema",
  "description": "Read-model clínico de solo lectura, versionado y por allow-list (feature 005) [REQ-SUM-001, REQ-SUM-002, REQ-SUM-003, REQ-SUM-006, INV-005-004]. Esquema cerrado: un campo nuevo del dominio NO aparece hasta que este contrato lo declare. Sin nombres de archivo (D5-06: viajan en SharedSummaryView.fileLabels), sin fotos de álbum, sin avatar, sin identificadores de usuario, hogar, mascota ni registro, sin claves ni URLs de objeto, sin `ownerUserId`, sin `revision` y sin interpretación automática (alertas, banderas, normal/anormal o texto generado; MAG-005-003). Las fechas de calendario son `YYYY-MM-DD` tal como se guardaron, sin conversión UTC (MAG-005-004); UTC solo en `generatedAt` y en `createdAt` de archivos.",
  "x-sdd-metadata": {
    "version": "1.2.0",
    "status": "DRAFT",
    "supersedes": "1.1.0",
    "change_type": "MINOR",
    "change_note": "MINOR 1.2.0 (feature 012, T1692/ENM-005-E 0.2.2, firmada por Neo 2026-11-28): SummaryScope +PETS (aditivo); la descripcion de ClinicalSummary.pets aclara que en PETS entran las mascotas elegidas sobre las que el creador es propietario principal o co-propietario ACTIVE (ENM-005-A). Sin cambio de forma en el resto. Historial: MINOR 1.1.0 (feature 007, EDGE-007-027 Opcion A de Neo, sin nuevo bump por seguir DRAFT: ClinicalProfile.age.required pierde totalDays (queda years, months; totalDays opcional) y ClinicalSummary.allOf gana la condicion if/then DECEASED sin deceasedAtIncluded true prohibe age.totalDays; los subesquemas de la regla condicional son objetos cerrados (additionalProperties false) que enumeran todas las propiedades de ClinicalSummary, SummaryDisclosure, ClinicalPetSummary, ClinicalProfile y age (true = sin restriccion adicional, false = prohibida), de modo que cerrar el if no altera su semantica y un campo nuevo en esos objetos exige actualizar tambien la regla; relaja un required, por lo que un lector 1.0.0 que lo exigiera debe tolerar su ausencia solo en DECEASED sin opt-in). MINOR 1.1.0 (feature 007, T1026, C1; DRAFT sin publicar, se pliega aqui la bandera de disclosure sin nuevo bump): disclosure +deceasedAtIncluded (boolean, opcional, fuera de required; ausente equivale a false) para reflejar includeDeceasedAt del enlace; ClinicalProfile +lifeStatus opcional (visible) y +deceasedAt opcional (disclosure opt-in del creador); ambos fuera de required, additionalProperties false se conserva; summaryVersion sigue 1.0.0 (formato del documento aditivo). Regla condicional if/else en ClinicalSummary (O1 de /rama, decision de Neo): pets[].profile.deceasedAt exige disclosure.deceasedAtIncluded true; sin bump porque sigue DRAFT y no restringe ningun documento valido emitido hasta ahora. Contrato nuevo de la feature 005 (T706). summaryVersion 1.0.0. Entrada única prevista para reportes de IA de la Fase 5 (sin contacto, sin nombres de archivo, sin interpretación).",
    "traceability": [
      "REQ-SUM-001",
      "REQ-SUM-002",
      "REQ-SUM-003",
      "REQ-SUM-006",
      "REQ-SUM-007",
      "REQ-SUM-008",
      "INV-005-004",
      "INV-005-009",
      "REQ-VET-009",
      "SC-005-027",
      "SC-005-028",
      "SC-005-029",
      "SC-005-030",
      "SC-005-033"
    ]
  },
  "$defs": {
    "SummaryScope": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "PET",
        "HOUSEHOLD",
        "PETS"
      ],
      "description": "Alcance del resumen (mascota, hogar o subconjunto de mascotas) [REQ-SUM-005]"
    },
    "SummaryDisclosure": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "microchipIncluded",
        "clinicalFilesIncluded"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "microchipIncluded": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "true solo si el creador marcó la casilla al crear el enlace o la vista previa (D5-14); la vista muestra «Microchip no compartido por el cuidador» cuando es false (MAG-005-005)"
        },
        "clinicalFilesIncluded": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "true solo si el creador marcó «Incluir archivos clínicos» (D5-21); con false, clinicalFiles es [] en todas las mascotas"
        },
        "deceasedAtIncluded": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Opcional (007, T1026): true solo si el creador marcó includeDeceasedAt; ausente equivale a false; con false, deceasedAt va ausente en ClinicalProfile"
        }
      },
      "description": "Entradas de privacidad del resumen; son parámetros de entrada de buildClinicalSummary (determinismo) [REQ-SUM-003, REQ-SUM-002]"
    },
    "ClinicalProfile": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "name",
        "species",
        "speciesOther",
        "breed",
        "sex",
        "neutered",
        "birthDate",
        "birthDateIsEstimate",
        "age"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 50
        },
        "species": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/pet.schema.json#/$defs/Species"
        },
        "speciesOther": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/pet.schema.json#/$defs/SpeciesOther"
        },
        "breed": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 60
        },
        "sex": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/pet.schema.json#/$defs/Sex"
        },
        "neutered": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "birthDate": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
        },
        "birthDateIsEstimate": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "lifeStatus": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["ALIVE", "DECEASED"],
          "description": "Opcional (007, T1026): estado de vida visible en el resumen; ausente equivale a ALIVE para lectores 1.0.0."
        },
        "deceasedAt": {
          "oneOf": [
            {"$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"},
            {"type": "null"}
          ],
          "description": "Opcional (007, T1026): fecha de fallecimiento; solo se incluye con disclosure opt-in del creador del enlace (desmarcado por defecto)."
        },
        "age": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "years",
            "months"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "years": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "months": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 11
            },
            "totalDays": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            }
          },
          "description": "Edad derivada aritméticamente de birthDate y de la fecha de calendario de generatedAt en UTC; no es una valoración clínica [MAG-005-003]"
        },
        "microchipId": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^\\d{15}$",
          "description": "AUSENTE (no null) salvo que disclosure.microchipIncluded sea true; dato declarado por el cuidador [D5-14, MAG-005-005]"
        }
      },
      "description": "Perfil clínico mínimo de la mascota; sin id, sin ownerUserId, sin avatar [REQ-SUM-003]"
    },
    "WeightEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "recordedAt",
        "weightKg",
        "notes"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "recordedAt": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
        },
        "weightKg": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0.001,
          "maximum": 150,
          "multipleOf": 0.001
        },
        "notes": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/OptionalNotes"
        }
      },
      "description": "Peso en kilogramos (unidad en el nombre del campo, MAG-005-014)"
    },
    "BodyMeasurementEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "recordedAt",
        "neckCm",
        "chestCm",
        "backLengthCm",
        "waistCm",
        "notes"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "recordedAt": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
        },
        "neckCm": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 250,
          "multipleOf": 0.01
        },
        "chestCm": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 250,
          "multipleOf": 0.01
        },
        "backLengthCm": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 250,
          "multipleOf": 0.01
        },
        "waistCm": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 250,
          "multipleOf": 0.01
        },
        "notes": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/OptionalNotes"
        }
      },
      "description": "Medidas en centímetros (unidad en el nombre del campo, MAG-005-014)"
    },
    "VaccinationEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "vaccineName",
        "appliedAt",
        "nextBoosterAt",
        "batchOrClinic",
        "veterinarianName",
        "notes"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "vaccineName": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 100
        },
        "appliedAt": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
        },
        "nextBoosterAt": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batchOrClinic": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "maxLength": 120
        },
        "veterinarianName": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "maxLength": 120
        },
        "notes": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/OptionalNotes"
        }
      },
      "description": "Sin veterinarianLicense (dato de un tercero, minimización) [REQ-SUM-003]"
    },
    "DewormingEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "productBrand",
        "dewormingType",
        "appliedAt",
        "nextSuggestedDoseAt",
        "batchOrClinic",
        "veterinarianName",
        "notes"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "productBrand": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 100
        },
        "dewormingType": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "INTERNAL",
            "EXTERNAL"
          ]
        },
        "appliedAt": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
        },
        "nextSuggestedDoseAt": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batchOrClinic": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "maxLength": 120
        },
        "veterinarianName": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "maxLength": 120
        },
        "notes": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/OptionalNotes"
        }
      },
      "description": "Sin veterinarianLicense (dato de un tercero, minimización) [REQ-SUM-003]"
    },
    "MedicalVisitEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "visitDate",
        "reason",
        "diagnosis",
        "treatment",
        "clinicOrVet",
        "observations"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "visitDate": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 200
        },
        "diagnosis": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 500
        },
        "treatment": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 500
        },
        "clinicOrVet": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 120
        },
        "observations": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/OptionalNotes"
        }
      },
      "description": "Texto libre del cuidador, no verificado; puede contener datos de terceros (RAMA-005-007) [REQ-SUM-007]"
    },
    "SymptomEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "recordedAt",
        "symptomType",
        "severity",
        "title",
        "description",
        "notes"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "recordedAt": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
        },
        "symptomType": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "enum": [
            "VOMIT",
            "APPETITE",
            "STOOL",
            "ENERGY",
            null
          ]
        },
        "severity": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "enum": [
            "MILD",
            "MODERATE",
            "SEVERE",
            null
          ]
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 120
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 1000
        },
        "notes": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/OptionalNotes"
        }
      },
      "description": "Parámetros de categoría SYMPTOM; reportados por el cuidador, sin valoración [REQ-SIN-003, MAG-005-015]"
    },
    "OtherParameterEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "recordedAt",
        "category",
        "title",
        "description",
        "notes"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "recordedAt": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoDate"
        },
        "category": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "DIET_CHANGE",
            "ALLERGY",
            "SURGERY",
            "BEHAVIOR",
            "OTHER"
          ]
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 120
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 1000
        },
        "notes": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/OptionalNotes"
        }
      },
      "description": "Parámetros adicionales distintos de SYMPTOM; reportados por el cuidador"
    },
    "ClinicalFileEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "mime",
        "sizeBytes",
        "createdAt"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/Uuid"
        },
        "mime": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/media.schema.json#/$defs/MediaMime"
        },
        "sizeBytes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 10485760
        },
        "createdAt": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoTimestamp"
        }
      },
      "description": "Archivo clínico (kind FILE) SIN nombre original, sin clave de objeto y sin URL. `id` es el identificador opaco del medio que la vista une con SharedSummaryView.fileLabels y con la ruta de descarga. `createdAt` es la fecha de SUBIDA, no la del examen (D5-04, MAG-005-009) [REQ-SUM-003, REQ-VET-009]"
    },
    "ClinicalPetSummary": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "profile",
        "weights",
        "bodyMeasurements",
        "vaccinations",
        "dewormings",
        "medicalVisits",
        "symptoms",
        "otherParameters",
        "clinicalFiles"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "profile": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ClinicalProfile"
        },
        "weights": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/WeightEntry"
          }
        },
        "bodyMeasurements": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/BodyMeasurementEntry"
          }
        },
        "vaccinations": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/VaccinationEntry"
          }
        },
        "dewormings": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/DewormingEntry"
          }
        },
        "medicalVisits": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/MedicalVisitEntry"
          }
        },
        "symptoms": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/SymptomEntry"
          }
        },
        "otherParameters": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/OtherParameterEntry"
          }
        },
        "clinicalFiles": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ClinicalFileEntry"
          }
        }
      },
      "description": "Una mascota del alcance. Listas por clave total (fecha DESC, id interno DESC); el id no se emite. Cada lista tiene cota de 5 000 elementos como envolvente de carga; superarla es un error interno, nunca un truncamiento silencioso [REQ-SUM-002]"
    },
    "ClinicalSummary": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "summaryVersion",
        "generatedAt",
        "scope",
        "dataProvenance",
        "automaticInterpretation",
        "disclosure",
        "pets"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "summaryVersion": {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "1.0.0"
        },
        "generatedAt": {
          "$ref": "https://argos.local/contracts/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/IsoTimestamp"
        },
        "scope": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SummaryScope"
        },
        "dataProvenance": {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "CAREGIVER_REPORTED_NOT_VERIFIED",
          "description": "Todo el contenido es registrado por el cuidador y no verificado por un profesional (MAG-005-001, REQ-SUM-007)"
        },
        "automaticInterpretation": {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "NONE",
          "description": "El resumen no contiene alertas, banderas, normal/anormal ni texto generado (MAG-005-003, REQ-SUM-008)"
        },
        "disclosure": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SummaryDisclosure"
        },
        "pets": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 100,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ClinicalPetSummary"
          },
          "description": "Mascotas del alcance, ordenadas por (name ASC, id interno ASC); en HOUSEHOLD solo las que el creador posee legalmente y siguen asignadas al hogar (D5-19); en PETS entran las mascotas elegidas sobre las que el creador es propietario principal o co-propietario ACTIVE (ENM-005-A)"
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "disclosure"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "summaryVersion": true,
              "generatedAt": true,
              "scope": true,
              "dataProvenance": true,
              "automaticInterpretation": true,
              "disclosure": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "deceasedAtIncluded"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "microchipIncluded": true,
                  "clinicalFilesIncluded": true,
                  "deceasedAtIncluded": {
                    "const": true
                  }
                }
              },
              "pets": true
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "pets": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "profile": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "name": true,
                        "species": true,
                        "speciesOther": true,
                        "breed": true,
                        "sex": true,
                        "neutered": true,
                        "birthDate": true,
                        "birthDateIsEstimate": true,
                        "lifeStatus": true,
                        "deceasedAt": false,
                        "age": true,
                        "microchipId": true
                      },
                      "if": {
                        "required": [
                          "lifeStatus"
                        ],
                        "properties": {
                          "lifeStatus": {
                            "const": "DECEASED"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "then": {
                        "properties": {
                          "age": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "additionalProperties": false,
                            "properties": {
                              "years": true,
                              "months": true,
                              "totalDays": false
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "weights": true,
                    "bodyMeasurements": true,
                    "vaccinations": true,
                    "dewormings": true,
                    "medicalVisits": true,
                    "symptoms": true,
                    "otherParameters": true,
                    "clinicalFiles": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Documento raíz [REQ-SUM-001]; regla condicional (007, O1 de /rama): pets[].profile.deceasedAt solo puede estar presente si disclosure.deceasedAtIncluded es true (ausente o false lo prohíbe), de modo que la garantía de privacidad vive también en el esquema y no solo en el constructor; regla EDGE-007-027 (Opción A de Neo): sin disclosure.deceasedAtIncluded true, una mascota con lifeStatus DECEASED no puede incluir age.totalDays (con birthDate revelaría la fecha exacta); age.totalDays es opcional (fuera de required) y ausente equivale a no publicado"
    }
  }
}
